<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="JISUB KIM BLOG privacy policy" pubDate={new Date('2026-11-16')} lang="en" alt="/privacy/">
	<p>
		JISUB KIM BLOG (qn51z.com, "the blog") respects the privacy of its visitors and follows the applicable laws.
		This policy explains what information is processed when you use the blog and how.
	</p>
	<h2>1. Information collected</h2>
	<p>
		The blog owner does not collect personal information from visitors directly. The blog is hosted on GitHub
		Pages, and GitHub may process records such as IP addresses for security and operations.
	</p>
	<h2>2. Comments (Giscus)</h2>
	<p>
		Comments are stored in GitHub Discussions through Giscus. You need to sign in with a GitHub account to comment,
		and your comment and GitHub username are public. They are handled under the
		<a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
	</p>
	<h2>3. Cookies and advertising</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>This blog may show third-party ads such as Google AdSense.</li>
		<li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this blog or other websites.</li>
		<li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this blog and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
		<li>You may opt out of personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
		<li>For details, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">How Google uses cookies in advertising</a>.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>4. Site statistics</h2>
	<p>The blog uses Google Search Console to see aggregated data such as search queries. This data is not used to identify individuals.</p>
	<h2>5. External links</h2>
	<p>External sites linked from posts are governed by their own privacy policies.</p>
	<h2>6. Contact</h2>
	<p>Privacy inquiries: <a href="mailto:qn51z07734@gmail.com">qn51z07734@gmail.com</a></p>
	<h2>7. Effective date</h2>
	<p>This policy applies from the date the site was published. Any changes will be posted on this page.</p>
	<p>The Korean version of this policy is the original.</p>
</Layout>
